# Super Intelligence: "At the beginning of the upkeep of enchanted creature's controller, that player draws a card." Bot1
# enchants Bot2's Ornithopter ({U} from Mox Sapphire) on turn 3, so Bot2, not Bot1, draws an extra card in their upkeep:
# on turn 4 Bot2 has drawn twice (hand 7 - 1 cast + the draw of turn 2, + the upkeep and the draw step of turn 4 = 9), and
# (Bot2 then discards to seven at cleanup); on turn 5 Bot1 draws only the card of the draw step (hand 7).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Super Intelligence
Island x5
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x6
Island x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
